         Exec Method: TopKScanExecState
         Scores: false
            TopK Order By: id asc
            TopK Limit: 5
         Tantivy Query: {"boolean":{"must":[{"heap_filter":{"indexed_query":{"boolean":{"must":[{"with_index":{"query":{"term":{"field":"description","value":"cardiology"}}}}]}},"field_filters":[],"recheck_filters":[{"heap_filter":"((specialty)::text > 'specialty49'::text)"}],"uses_tid_bitmap":true}}]}}
         ->  Bitmap Index Scan on providers_specialty_c
               Index Cond: ((specialty)::text > 'specialty49'::text)
(12 rows)

